<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Miners strike at S.Africa Chromecorp mine.</title>
<headline>Miners strike at S.Africa Chromecorp mine.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Workers at Chromecorp's Chrombronne mine went on strike on Tuesday to protest the dismissal of two union leaders by the mine, the South African National Union of mineworkers said.</p>
<p>The union said in a statement the leaders were dismissed for &quot;misinforming workers&quot; and about 400 of the 600 workers went on strike demanding their reinstatement.</p>
<p>The matter has been taken to the Commission for Conciliation, Mediation and Arbitration which will sit on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The mine contributes 47,000 tons of saleable product per month to Chromecorp's total 107,000 tons of the product per month.</p>
<p>The mine could not immediately be reached for comment.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
